cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "US Sauna & Cold Plunge Venue Data"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and link to findsaunaplunge.com."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "FindSaunaPlunge"
    website: "https://findsaunaplunge.com"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://findsaunaplunge.com/data/us-sauna-cold-plunge/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/findsaunaplunge/data"
abstract: >-
  Cold plunge, sauna and contrast-therapy venues across US metros, each record
  carrying the date its details were last checked. Published temperatures and
  prices are read from each venue's own pages; absent fields mean the venue does
  not publish the detail, never zero. Monthly snapshots of the live feed at
  https://findsaunaplunge.com/api/v1/venues.json.
